    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Sang'weli kūtūng'wa Betelehemu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 16:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ū SEEBA ūng'wīla ū Sang'weli, “Ūkwikala ūkūnīlīīlaga ū Saulo kūshisha nanalī, alīyo ū nene naanemile ū kūbiza ntemi wa Baisilaeli? Yookajage maguta ī mhembe yako ūje Betelehemu, nalīkūtūma ng'wa Yese, nguno ūmò wa bintūnja bakwe nansolile abize ntemi.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.16.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.16.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 16:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo ū Sang'weli ūhaya, “Nakūja mu mbika kī? Nguno ū Saulo akūnibūlaga ūlū aligwe!” Ū SEEBA ūng'wīla, “Solaga ndogoosa ya ng'ombe ūje nayo ūkabawīle gīkī, ‘Nizaga kūmfunīja SEEBA shitambò.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.16.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.16.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 16:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nū Yese ūkūng'witana wize ū kū shitambò, hūna ī ya kwīta nakūkūlangīīla nene. Ūyo nalaakoolekeje hū ng'wene ūkūng'witīīla a maguta kūlwa nguno yane.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.16.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.16.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 16:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Sang'weli wīta gīt'ūmo SEEBA akang'wīlīla, aho washika ī Betelehemu a banamhala ba mu nzengo būnsūng'wanha kūnū bakūdetemaga; būmūūja, “Wizaga mu mhola baba?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.16.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.16.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 16:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sang'weli nang'hwe ūshosha, “Alichene nizaga mu mhola dūhū; nizaga kūmfunīja SEEBA shitambò, iyeejagi ng'wize hamò nane ū kū shitambò.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.16.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.16.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Daūdi kūsolwa abize ntemi",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 16:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.16.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.16.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 16:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bahayūshika, ū Sang'weli aho wamona Eliabu wiganika, “Ū ng'witīīlwa maguta o ng'wa SEEBA atūduuma kūbiza ūyū wīmīīlaga kū būtongi bo ng'wa SEEBA ng'wenūyū.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.16.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.16.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 16:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo ū SEEBA ūng'wīla, “Ūtaadutagwe ihanga lya suso yakwe nūūlū būlīhu wakwe; nguno naanemaga. Ū SEEBA atalolaga gīt'ūmo munhū akalolelaga. Nguno ū munhū akalolaga ihanga lya higūlya, alīyo ū SEEBA akalolaga mu gatī mu ng'holò.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.16.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.16.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 16:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ū Yese ūng'witana Abinadabu, ūng'wīla abīte ū kū būtongi bo ng'wa Sang'weli. Alīyo ū Sang'weli ūhaya, “Ū SEEBA atansolile nūūlū ū ng'wenūyū.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.16.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.16.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 16:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Yese ūng'wenha Shama, nang'hwe wiza ūbīta; alīyo nū ng'wene ū Sang'weli ūhaya, “Ū SEEBA atansolile nū ng'wenūyū.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.16.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.16.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 16:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Yese ūbabītya bitūnja bakwe mpungatī ū kū būtongi bo ng'wa Sang'weli, alīyo ū Sang'weli ūng'wīla, “Ū SEEBA atabasolile a benaba.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.16.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.16.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 16:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ūmūūja ū Yese, “A benaba h'a bitūnja bako bose pye abo ūlī nabo?” Ū Yese ūshosha, “Alīho na nzuna wabo ndo, kwangūlīja; gwike ī haha alīdīīma ng'holo.” Nang'hwe ū Sang'weli ūhaya, “Tūmaga koi munhū akitanwe, nguno tūtigasha aho ataalī ū kūshika.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.16.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.16.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 16:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūtūma ng'hana ūūkenhwa wiza wingīla ū mu kaya; walī nyanda ngīlīng'hanu w'ikoba lyaaza, nī suso yakwe nsoga. Hūna ū SEEBA ūhaya, “Būūkaga ūng'witīīle maguta, nguno hū ng'wene.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.16.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.16.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 16:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na ng'hana ū Sang'weli ūbūūka wīsola ī mhembe yakwe ya maguta, ūng'witīīla kū būtongi wa bakūlūye. Kūfuma ikanza lyenīlo, ū Moyo o ng'wa SEEBA ūng'wizīīla ū Daūdi na ngunzu ningī. Na lūūlū ū Sang'weli ūja kaya.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.16.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.16.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Daūdi ng'wikūlū lya ng'wa Saulo",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 16:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.16.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.16.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 16:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Moyo o ng'wa SEEBA akasangwa wanekile ū Saulo, ūyūluhiwa na moyo gwabūbi kūfuma kūlī SEEBA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.16.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.16.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 16:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna a batūmami bakwe ū Saulo būng'wīla, “Baba ntemi, ūkūluhiagwa moyo gwabūbi gwa kūfuma kūlī SEEBA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.16.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.16.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 16:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ni walagīja gīkī a bise basese bako abo tūlīho aha, tūkoobe munhū koolī wa kūtūla ndono. Ū moyo gwabūbi ūlū gwakwizīīla kūfuma ū kūlī SEEBA wakūtūlīla, kūshisha gwīnga wifuula.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.16.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.16.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 16:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Saulo ūbawīla a batūmami bakwe, “Būgatū nkoobagi lūūlū ū munhū wa kūdūla kūtūla chiza munenhele.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.16.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.16.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 16:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ūmò wa batūmami bakwe ūhaya, “Ū nene namona alīho ng'witūnja o ng'wa Yese muna Betelehemu; ū nsūmba ng'wenūyo amanile no ū kūtūla ī ndono. Hangī nīyo ngosha shisha ng'holò, nū kū būlūgū tūūlaga ooshikaga; munhū wa suso yawiza na ndeeba mu kalūngalūngīle; hama ū SEEBA alī hamò nang'hwe gete.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.16.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.16.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 16:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na lūūlū ū Saulo ūtūma munhū kūja ī ng'wa Yese; ūng'wīla alīhaya, “Nitūmīlage ū ng'witūnja wako ū Daūdi ū ndīīmi wa ng'holo.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.16.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.16.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 16:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yese nang'hwe ūsola nzobe wībbakīlīja migatī na shisaabo sha divai, na kabūli kasongi; ūntūma ū ng'witūnja wakwe ū Daūdi ūja nasho ī ng'wa Saulo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.16.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.16.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 16:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Daūdi aho washika ī ng'wa Saulo, nang'hwe ūbiza ūmò wa batūmami bakwe; nīyo ū Saulo ūntogwa no ū Daūdi, ūng'wīta kūbiza ūmò wa babūūcha ba shilanga shakwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.16.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.16.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 16:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ū Saulo ūtūma nhūng'wa ū kūlī Yese alīhaya, “Nzunīlījage ū Daūdi abize ūmò wa batūmami bane, nguno waniyegije no.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.16.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.16.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 16:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Būl'ikanza ūlū gwang'wizīīla ū Saulo ū moyo gwabūbi kūfuma kūlī SEEBA, ū Daūdi wīsolaga ī ndono yaakwe wītūla, gwang'wīnga ū Saulo ū moyo gwabūbi, wifuula.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.16.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.16.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
